- Current freeze: **Weeks 1–6 closed** (Week 6: 2026-09-21, tag `week-06-done`).
- **Current week is Weeks 7–8 — NOT STARTED.** Surrogate ladder + information
  ledger. Do not implement until the user asks. Do not start Week 9 until
  `week-08-done`.
- Catch-up on an earlier incomplete week is allowed. Skipping forward is not.

If the user asks to jump ahead, refuse, name the open exit criterion, and stay on that week.
